The ability to disperse the evil spirits in another creature or object
is one of a houngan's more useful abilities.  Most magical or ritualistic
affects can be dispersed, although some creatures may become enraged by
the loss of their power.

The number of effects that can be removed in a single casting depends
on the caster's level:
  Level  1-30:  up to 1 effect
  Level 31-60:  up to 2 effects
  Level 61-90:  up to 3 effects
  Level 91+:    up to 4 effects

The effects targeted are chosen at random.  The target will make a
saving throw for each effect to preserve effects that are beneficial
to that target.  Detrimental effects are guaranteed to be removed when targeted.
